==== Yuichiro Mukai / X: @yucchiy_ / GitHub: @yucchiy
Applibot, Inc. Technology Division

Responsible for writing "@<title>{mukai-yuichiro-2}". @<br>{}
At the Technology Division of Applibot, Inc., he works on project support. He is certified in the Unity area as one of CyberAgent's "Developer Experts" (@<href>{https://www.cyberagent.co.jp/techinfo/info/detail/id=31305}).
Personally, he serializes "Unity Weekly", a weekly roundup of Unity news, on his blog (@<href>{https://blog.yucchiy.com}), writes "UniTips" with in-house volunteers for Technical Book Fair, and develops "UniCli", a tool for operating Unity from the CLI.

